{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Mom Brain 是一款為家庭照顧者而設的資料整理工具，將孩子的尺寸、衣物尺碼、藥物、學校資訊、活動安排、文件與照片集中存放，讓你不用再回想資料到底存在哪裡。程式由一位四孩之母開發，原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>按孩子分類並自然搜尋</h2>\n<p>可為每個孩子建立個人檔案，記錄身高體重、衣物尺碼、藥物、醫生、學校與活動等資料，並可自訂欄位；全家庭共用的資訊則放在 Shared Details。筆記、日期、照片與附件都存放在同一處，並保留資料變更紀錄。搜尋時可用日常問法，例如「上次買的頭盔是甚麼尺碼」，即可在已儲存內容中找出答案。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-214-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-215-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-216-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-217-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-218-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-219-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Mom Brain: Family Details</li>\n<li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T23:39:12.009811+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":327,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T23:33:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T06:38:19.500043+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T23:37:39.495150+00:00","content_hash":"f9cc6afad08050e3f1676c41caca33caba8e1288da57c0cf213b6178bdf20861","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}